SAFETY

data/curated/ contains deliberately malicious prompt-injection samples and malicious
agent skills (SKILL.md files and bundled scripts). They are test fixtures for detectors.
Never install, load or execute them as agent skills, tools or prompts. All network
hosts in them use the reserved example.com / example.net domains.

